cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "European Synthesizer Market Observatory — Open Dataset"
authors:
  - name: "European Synthesizer Market Observatory"
    website: "https://intellisynthprices.com"
version: "2026-05"
date-released: "2026-05-12"
url: "https://github.com/albertjimrod/eusynth-market-data"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >
  Aggregate price statistics for second-hand synthesizers collected from
  European online marketplaces (Hispasonic, Soundsmarket, Audiofanzine, Noiz).
  Includes fair market price estimates (P25/P50/P75) for 122 models and a
  canonical product catalogue of 3,037 synthesizer models.
keywords:
  - synthesizers
  - second-hand market
  - price data
  - open data
  - music instruments
  - Europe
